      "cooked": "<p>In the <strong>Purchase Order</strong>, I request items using the <strong>Kilogram (Kg)</strong> unit.<br>\nHowever, during <strong>Purchase Receipt</strong>, I receive the items using different units such as <strong>Piece</strong> or <strong>Carton</strong>.</p>\n<p>I have already set up the UOM Conversion inside the Item, so that Piece and Carton convert correctly to Kilogram.<br>\nBut when I try to submit the Purchase Receipt with a different UOM, I get the following error:</p>\n<p>**Incorrect value in row 1: UOM must be equal to ‘Kg’<br>\n**</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/1/91ada5576fe4f7e06c1e2a3fa01033e1d81b4b47.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/91ada5576fe4f7e06c1e2a3fa01033e1d81b4b47\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/1/91ada5576fe4f7e06c1e2a3fa01033e1d81b4b47_2_690x159.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"kMJgBi8o6Jqk5LoyIw0uVENRupp\" width=\"690\" height=\"159\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/1/91ada5576fe4f7e06c1e2a3fa01033e1d81b4b47_2_690x159.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/1/91ada5576fe4f7e06c1e2a3fa01033e1d81b4b47_2_1035x238.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/1/91ada5576fe4f7e06c1e2a3fa01033e1d81b4b47.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FBFBFB\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1039×240 10.6 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
